TI  - MORPHOLOGY, SEDIMENTS, AND DEPOSITIONAL-ENVIRONMENTS OF A SMALL CARBONATE PLATFORM - SERRANILLA BANK, NICARAGUAN RISE, SOUTHWEST CARIBBEAN SEA
T2  - JOURNAL OF SEDIMENTARY PETROLOGY
