TI  - HYDRAULIC DYNAMICS AND WATER QUALITY INFLUENCE OF JOHOR RIVERS IN THE JOHOR STRAIT: A COMPREHENSIVE ANALYSIS
T2  - PROCEEDINGS OF THE 41ST IAHR WORLD CONGRESS
LA  - English
CP  - 41st IAHR World Congress
