TI  - Algal Turf Sediments and Sediment Production by Parrotfishes across the Continental Shelf of the Northern Great Barrier Reef
T2  - PLOS ONE
LA  - English
KW  - LIMITED FUNCTIONAL REDUNDANCY
KW  - INSHORE TURBID REEFS
KW  - CORAL-REEFS
KW  - INNER-SHELF
KW  - COMMUNITY STRUCTURE
