TI  - Jurassic limestones used in the Almaqah Temple of Sirwah, Northern Jemen - use, weathering, and source
T2  - ZEITSCHRIFT DER DEUTSCHEN GESELLSCHAFT FUR GEOWISSENSCHAFTEN
LA  - German
KW  - Jemen
KW  - Sirwah
