TI  - The Paleochrono-1.1 probabilistic model to derive a common age model for several paleoclimatic sites using absolute and relative dating constraints
T2  - GEOSCIENTIFIC MODEL DEVELOPMENT
LA  - English
KW  - EPICA DOME-C
KW  - ANTARCTIC ICE CORE
KW  - CHRONOLOGICAL FRAMEWORK
KW  - PART 2
KW  - GREENLAND
KW  - RECORD
