TI  - Ice-rafting from the British-Irish ice sheet since the earliest Pleistocene (2.6 million years ago): implications for long-term mid-latitudinal ice-sheet growth in the North Atlantic region
T2  - QUATERNARY SCIENCE REVIEWS
LA  - English
KW  - British-Irish Ice Sheet
KW  - Ice-rafted detritus (IRD)
KW  - NE Atlantic
KW  - Pleistocene
