TI  - Reconstruction of storm/tsunami records over the last 4000 years using transported coral blocks and lagoon sediments in the southern South China Sea
T2  - QUATERNARY INTERNATIONAL
LA  - English
CP  - Workshop on Hurricanes and Typhoons - From the Field Records to the Forecast
KW  - GREAT-BARRIER-REEF
KW  - HURRICANE ACTIVITY
KW  - TROPICAL CYCLONES
KW  - U-SERIES
