TI  - Neochoiaella n. gen. (Demospongeae, Choiaellidae)-a second poriferan Lazarus taxon from the Solnhofen Plattenkalk (Upper Jurassic, Southern Germany)?
T2  - PALAEONTOLOGISCHE ZEITSCHRIFT
