TI  - The grazing impact of megaherbivores on sediment accumulation and stabilization functions of seagrass meadows in a subtropical coral reef lagoon
T2  - LIMNOLOGY AND OCEANOGRAPHY
LA  - English
KW  - POSIDONIA-OCEANICA
KW  - WAVE ATTENUATION
