TI  - INFLUENCE OF ORIGINAL FABRIC ON SUBSEQUENT POROSITY EVOLUTION - AN EXAMPLE FROM THE CORALLIAN (UPPER JURASSIC) REEFAL LIMESTONES, THE WEALD BASIN, SOUTHERN ENGLAND
