TI  - Climate Adaptation for a Natural Atoll Island in the Maldives - Predicting the Long-Term Morphological Response of Coral Islands to Sea Level Rise and the Effect of Hazard Mitigation Strategies
T2  - EARTHS FUTURE
LA  - English
KW  - atoll islands
KW  - sea level rise
