TI  - Diagenetic comparisons between non-tropical Cenozoic limestones of New Zealand and tropical Mississippian limestones from Indiana, USA: Is the non-tropical model better than the tropical model?
T2  - SEDIMENTARY GEOLOGY
LA  - English
KW  - limestone
