TI  - THE TORRES REEFS, NORTH QUEENSLAND, AUSTRALIA - STRONG TIDAL FLOWS A MODERN CONTROL ON THEIR GROWTH
T2  - CORAL REEFS
LA  - English
KW  - PAPUA-NEW-GUINEA
