TI  - Geomorphic and Sedimentologic Evidence of Extreme Wave Events Recorded by Beachrocks: A Case Study from the Island of St. Bartholomew (Lesser Antilles)
T2  - JOURNAL OF COASTAL RESEARCH
LA  - English
KW  - Beachrock
