TI  - Mass occurrence of the large solitary rugose coral Phaulactis angusta at the boundary Lower/Upper Visby Formation in the Silurian of Gotland, Sweden: palaeoecology and depositional implications
T2  - GFF
LA  - English
KW  - Silurian
KW  - Gotland
KW  - Ireviken event
