TI  - Micritic fabrics define sharp margins of Wenlock patch reefs (middle Silurian) in Gotland and England
T2  - PALAEOZOIC REEFS AND BIOACCUMULATIONS: CLIMATIC AND EVOLUTIONARY CONTROLS
LA  - English
CP  - International Meeting on Climate and Evolutionary Controls on Palaeozoic Reefs and Bioaccumulations
