TI  - Coupled evolution between plant hydrologic cycle and organic reef from Late Devonian to Mississippian
T2  - CHINESE SCIENCE BULLETIN-CHINESE
LA  - Chinese
KW  - seed plant
KW  - hydrologic cycle
KW  - metazoan reef
KW  - anoxia
KW  - climate cooling
