TI  - SURFICIAL COOL-WATER CARBONATE SEDIMENTS ON THE OTWAY CONTINENTAL-MARGIN, SOUTHEASTERN AUSTRALIA
T2  - MARINE GEOLOGY
LA  - English
KW  - SOUTH-AUSTRALIA
KW  - BASS STRAIT
KW  - NEW-ZEALAND
