TI  - Calcium carbonate cycling in future oceans and its influence on future climates
T2  - JOURNAL OF PLANKTON RESEARCH
LA  - English
KW  - COCCOLITHOPHORID EMILIANIA-HUXLEYI
KW  - MODERN INTERDECADAL VARIABILITY
