TI  - Distribution and remineralization of organic carbon in sediments of a mangrove stand partly contaminated with sewage waste
T2  - AMBIO
LA  - English
KW  - FOREST
KW  - NITROGEN
KW  - FLUXES
KW  - SULFUR
KW  - PLANTS
