a from published calibration studies using IUPAC parameters was initiated independently by several groups including (in no particular order) coauthors S. V. P., A. J. S., K. W. H., M. D., and A. S. C. These efforts were combined into one project spearheaded by S. V. P., who designed the present study, reprocessed all data, and wrote the manuscript. W. F. D. performed Delta<INF>47-TE</INF> calculations. C. S. performed Monte Carlo analysis. M. D. performed ANCOVA analysis and error propagation in reconstructed temperatures and made associated figures. J. R. K. compiled references. C. S. and S. V. P. designed EarthChem template. C. S., M. D., C. M. J., S. M. B., A. S. C., K. W. H., J. R. K., T. K., G. A. O., and A. J. S. consulted on study design. For each published study providing data, the first author and laboratory lead were included as coauthors, plus additional workers not involved in the original publications but who contributed significantly to assembling data for reprocessing. These "data contributing authors" are listed in alphabetical order but are attributed to each study as follows: Defliese (W. F. D. and K. C. L.), Winkelstern (I. Z. W. and K. C. L.), Kluge (T. K. and C. M. J.), Garcia (C. M. J.), Kelson (J. R. K. and K. W. H.), Tang (R. V., B. E. R., and A. T.), Fernandez (A. B. F., R. V., and B. E. R.), Passey (B. H. P.), Peral (M. D. and M. P.), Henkes (G. A. H. and B. H. P.), Petrizzo (D. A. P. and E. D. Y.), Wacker (U. W., D. B., and J. F.), Katz (A. K. and M. B.), and Breitenbach (S. F. M. B. and D. A. H.). All authors edited and approved the manuscript.
