TI  - The descriptive nomenclature and classification of growth fabrics in fossil scleractinian reefs
T2  - SEDIMENTARY GEOLOGY
LA  - English
CP  - Session on Reef Carbonate and Carbonate Platform Sediments at the 30th International Geological Congress
KW  - coral reefs
