TI  - Sedimentary records of human activity and natural environmental evolution in sensitive ecosystems: A case study of a coral nature reserve in Dongshan Bay and a mangrove forest nature reserve in Zhangjiang River estuary, Southeast China
T2  - ORGANIC GEOCHEMISTRY
LA  - English
KW  - Human activity
KW  - Mangroves
