TI  - FACIES OF THE UPPER JURASSIC-LOWER CRETACEOUS DEPOSITS FROM THE SOUTHERN PART OF THE CARPATHIAN FOREDEEP BASEMENT IN THE KRAKOW-RZESZOW AREA (SOUTHERN POLAND)
