TI  - PALEOGEOGRAPHIC, LITHOLOGICAL-GEOCHEMICAL FEATURES AND BITUMINITY OF ZHIVETIAN DEPOSITS OF THE MIDDLE DEVONIAN OF THE ALTAI-SAYAN FOLDED REGION
T2  - BULLETIN OF THE TOMSK POLYTECHNIC UNIVERSITY-GEO ASSETS ENGINEERING
LA  - Russian
KW  - Altai-Sayan fold area
KW  - Zhivetian deposits
