TI  - Tectonic-sedimentary evolution of the western margin of the Mesozoic Vardar Ocean: evidence from the Pelagonian and Almopias zones, northern Greece
T2  - TECTONIC DEVELOPMENT OF THE EASTERN MEDITERRANEAN REGION
LA  - English
