TI  - Distribution, geometry and palaeogeography of the Frasnian (Late Devonian) reef complexes of Banks Island, NWT, western arctic, Canada
T2  - DEVONIAN CHANGE: CASE STUDIES IN PALAEOGEOGRAPHY AND PALAEOECOLOGY
LA  - English
KW  - MASS EXTINCTION
KW  - CORALS
KW  - TEMPERATURE
